<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ACC Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ACC Corp started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns initiated coverage of ACC Corp with an attractive rating, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- ACC Corp gained 1-1/2 to 26-1/8.</p>
